  "rulings": [
    {
      "comment": "To activate a cohort ability, the Ally with that ability must have been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn. Informally, it can\u2019t have \u201csummoning sickness.\u201d However, the other Ally you tap can be one that just came under your control. (Note that tapping the second Ally doesn\u2019t use {T} [the tap symbol].)",
      "oracle_id": "017f4471-db5a-4ad0-97b3-b1f12b52578a",
      "published_at": "2016-01-22",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "You can tap any two untapped Humans you control, including ones you haven\u2019t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Devout Chaplain\u2019s activated ability. You must have controlled Devout Chaplain continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, however.",
